OL,3,GNEWSATwo babies in hospital after
OL,4,Asix-vehicle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo babies and an adult were taken to
OL,7,Fhospital after six vehicles crashed at
OL,8,Fthe end of an A14 slip-road in Suffolk.
OL,10,FIt happened at the Claydon junction at
OL,11,Fabout 17:30 GMT on Tuesday, causing the
OL,12,Fwestbound carriageway to be closed
OL,13,Fbetween junctions 52 and 51.
OL,15,FSuffolk's fire service said crews found
OL,16,Ftwo separate but related crashes, with
OL,17,Fone involving four vehicles that had
OL,18,Fcollided end-to-end containing five
OL,19,Fadults and two babies.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
